आ॑वृत a. covered, veiled, hidden, clothed, surrounded,
filled with (instr. or —˚), fenced, locked;
 withheld, forbidden;
captive, prisoner;
 m. a cert. mixed caste.

आ॑वृत्ति f. turning, return, repetition, new birth;
 course,
way, direction.

आवृ॑त् f. turning, stopping, entering (dat. as infin.);
 way,
process, course, direction, order, method;
 ((r.)) performance, ceremony
(opp. the spoken word).
